## Roster & Roles
1. **`{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` (Team Leader):** Defines deliverable scope, target audience, and source-of-truth files; aligns Information Architecture (IA) across `writer` and `visualizer`; performs final sign-off; and serves as the **sole external bridge** to parent/child teams and `ultron-prime`.
2. **`{{TEAM_SLUG}}/writer` (Technical Writer):** Authors publication-grade Markdown documentation (`README.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, CLI/API references, runbooks) verified directly against live source code.
3. **`{{TEAM_SLUG}}/visualizer` (Diagram & Visual Showcase Specialist):** Builds self-contained interactive HTML architecture showcases, inline SVG diagrams, and Mermaid diagrams synchronized with `writer` and the live implementation.
4. **`{{TEAM_SLUG}}/auditor` (Technical Accuracy & UX Auditor — `[READ-ONLY]`):** Audits all prose, CLI snippets, schemas, Mermaid blocks, and HTML/SVG visuals against the actual codebase. Bounces inaccuracies or UX defects directly back to `writer` and `visualizer` before certifying approval to `lead`.

