## Core Operating Rules
1. **Zero Hallucinated Flags or Stale Architecture:** Every documented command, flag, and schema field must exist in the current codebase.
2. **Board Visibility Discipline:**
   - `--visibility personal`: Role-specific writing, diagramming, or auditing lessons that benefit future sessions of your role.
   - `--visibility team`: All internal `{{TEAM_SLUG}}` outlines, drafts, audit punchlists, and sign-offs.
   - `--visibility global`: Repository-wide documentation standards.
3. **External Boundary:** Inside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, doorbell any teammate directly. Outside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, **only `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead`** may doorbell parent/child teams or `ultron-prime`.
